// Durability, replay and approval for agent runs.
//
// A run journals one append-only line per effecting call at
// `<journal>/<run_id>.jsonl` with `run`, `step`, `kind`, `input_digest`,
// `output_digest`, `idempotency_key`, `timestamp` and usage. Records are
// flushed before an effecting call returns, so a re-run with the same
// `run_id` resolves recorded outputs instead of executing effects again and
// the report says `"replay":true`. Payloads are stored only when
// `AgentSpec.journal_payloads` is set.
//
// Approval decisions and governed assertions are journaled the same way, which
// is what makes replay replay-safe: a recorded decision is returned rather
// than asked again, and `approve` with no approver attached is a deny.
//
// The record format is frozen in `docs/adr/0018-agent-run-contract.md`; the
// implementation lives in `packages/spectra-agent/src/journal.rs` and
// `packages/spectra-agent/src/replay.rs`. No declaration is published here.
